00000000001,"height":25.0,"seed":2139410384,"groupIds":[],"frameId":"ax63wCE39PGM3vqL","roundness":null,"boundElements":[],"updated":1,"link":null,"locked":false,"fontSize":11,"fontFamily":3,"text":"1. REGISTRO MAESTRO DE CONSENTIMIENTOS & AUDITORÍA FORENSE","textAlign":"left","verticalAlign":"top","containerId":null,"originalText":"1. REGISTRO MAESTRO DE CONSENTIMIENTOS & AUDITORÍA FORENSE","lineHeight":1.25,"baseline":11},{"type":"rectangle","version":1,"versionNonce":557598130,"isDeleted":false,"id":"Qj0wLqGrkwWWqCWy","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":1.5,"strokeStyle":"solid","roughness":0,"opacity":100,"angle":0.0,"x":30.0,"y":170.0,"strokeColor":"#86EFAC","backgroundColor":"#F0FDF4","width":760.0,"height":260.0,"seed":963992040,"groupIds":[],"frameId":"ax63wCE39PGM3vqL","roundness":{"type":3},"boundElements":[{"id":"wLCd3nxS4zdn1Val","type":"text"}],"updated":1,"link":null,"locked":false},{"type":"text","version":1,"versionNonce":37250651,"isDeleted":false,"id":"wLCd3nxS4zdn1Val","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":1.5,"strokeStyle":"solid","roughness":0,"opacity":100,"angle":0.0,"x":30.0,"y":202.8,"strokeColor":"#0F172A","backgroundColor":"transparent","width":760.0,"height":194.4,"seed":1795173207,"groupIds":[],"frameId":"ax63wCE39PGM3vqL","roundness":null,"boundElements":[],"updated":1,"link":null,"locked":false,"fontSize":12,"fontFamily":2,"text":"ESTRUCTURA DE EVIDENCIA DIGITAL INMUTABLE (LOG FORENSE):\n\nCada consentimiento genera un registro inmutable con la siguiente estructura:\n• consent_id: UUID v4 único e irrepetible\n• user_id / student_id / representative_id\n• consent_type: TERMS | PRIVACY | MINOR_DATA | IMAGE_VOICE | MARKETING\n• document_version: Ej. POL-DAT-001 v2.0 (versionamiento estricto)\n• accepted: true · accepted_at: Timestamp ISO 8601 con hora legal\n• ip_address, user_agent, channel (Web / Mobile)\n• status: ACTIVO · revoked_at (cuando aplique) · revocation_reason\n\nObjetivo: Responder con certeza ante la SIC: ¿Quién aceptó, qué versión exacta vio y cuándo?","textAlign":"left","verticalAlign":"middle","containerId":"Qj0wLqGrkwWWqCWy","originalText":"ESTRUCTURA DE EVIDENCIA DIGITAL INMUTABLE (LOG FORENSE):\n\nCada consentimiento genera un registro inmutable con la siguiente estructura:\n• consent_id: UUID v4 único e irrepetible\n• user_id / student_id / representative_id\n• consent_type: TERMS | PRIVACY | MINOR_DATA | IMAGE_VOICE | MARKETING\n• document_version: Ej. POL-DAT-001 v2.0 (versionamiento estricto)\n• accepted: true · accepted_at: Timestamp ISO 8601 con hora legal\n• ip_address, user_agent, channel (Web / Mobile)\n• status: ACTIVO · revoked_at (cuando aplique) · revocation_reason\n\nObjetivo: Responder con certeza ante la SIC: ¿Quién aceptó, qué versión exacta vio y cuándo?","lineHeight":1.25,"baseline":12,"autoResize":true},{"type":"rectangle","version":1,"versionNonce":2087122399,"isDeleted":false,"id":"jXEkdWUo8MR4tcJY","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":1.5,"strokeStyle":"solid","roughness":0,"opacity":100,"angle":0.0,"x":30.0,"y":450.0,"strokeColor":"#93C5FD","backgroundColor":"#EFF6FF","width":760.0,"height":200.0,"seed":733357620,"groupIds":[],"frameId":"ax63wCE39PGM3vqL","roundness":{"type":3},"boundElements":[{"id":"ygIfuR77Pm3sMIlc","type":"text"}],"updated":1,"link":null,"locked":false},{"type":"text","version":1,"versionNonce":1911802882,"isDeleted":false,"id":"ygIfuR77Pm3sMIlc","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":1.5,"strokeStyle":"solid","roughness":0,"opacity":100,"angle":0.0,"x":30.0,"y":501.4,"strokeColor":"#0F172A","backgroundColor":"transparent","width":760.0,"height":97.2,"seed":1010577346,"groupIds":[],"frameId":"ax63wCE39PGM3vqL","roundness":null,"boundElements":[],"updated":1,"link":null,"locked":false,"fontSize":12,"fontFamily":2,"text":"REGISTRO NACIONAL DE BASES DE DATOS (RNBD / SIC):\n\n• Dec. 90/2018: Sujetos obligados: Activos totales > 100.000 UVT o entidades públicas.\n• Regla Clave: No estar obligado al RNBD NO exime de cumplir la Ley 1581.\n• Res. 56579 de 2025: Actualización de instrucciones oficiales del RNBD ante la SIC.\n• Deber permanente: Mantener política, avisos, autorizaciones y medidas de seguridad.","textAlign":"left","verticalAlign":"middle","containerId":"jXEkdWUo8MR4tcJY","originalText":"REGISTRO NACIONAL DE BASES DE DATOS (RNBD / SIC):\n\n• Dec. 90/2018: Sujetos obligados: Activos totales > 100.000 UVT o entidades públicas.\n• Regla Clave: No estar obligado al RNBD NO exime de cumplir la Ley 1581.\n• Res. 56579 de 2025: Actualización de instrucciones oficiales del RNBD ante la SIC.\n• Deber permanente: Mantener política, avisos, autorizaciones y medidas de seguridad.","lineHeight":1.25,"baseline":12,"autoResize":true},{"type":"rectangle","version":1,"versionNonce":1176167588,"isDeleted":false,"id":"MJ7AIz7l0ae5bmNt","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":1.5,"strokeStyle":"solid","roughness":0,"opacity":100,"angle":0.0,"x":30.0,"y":670.0,"strokeColor":"#CBD5E1","backgroundColor":"#F8FAFC","width":760.0,"height":185.0,"seed":733472835,"groupIds":[],"frameId":"ax63wCE39PGM3vqL","roundness":{"type":3},"boundElements":[{"id":"WAhN8kfEcs57f5NW","type":"text"}],"updated":1,"link":null,"locked":false},{"type":"text","version":1,"versionNonce":1864187552,"isDeleted":false,"id":"WAhN8kfEcs57f5NW","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":1.5,"strokeStyle":"solid","roughness":0,"opacity":100,"angle":0.0,"x":30.0,"y":713.9,"strokeColor":"#0F172A","backgroundColor":"transparent","width":760.0,"height":97.2,"seed":815883381,"groupIds":[],"frameId":"ax63wCE39PGM3vqL","roundness":null,"boundElements":[],"updated":1,"link":null,"locked":false,"fontSize":12,"fontFamily":2,"text":"MATRIZ DE RETENCIÓN Y SUPRESIÓN PERIÓDICA:\n\n• Cuentas y notas: Durante la relación contractual + 5 años.\n• Facturación y pagos: 10 años conforme a la obligación fiscal DIAN.\n• Grabaciones de clase: Plazo definido por ciclo académico (prohibido 'para siempre').\n• Consentimientos y logs: Conservación permanente como evidencia de cumplimiento.","textAlign":"left","verticalAlign":"middle","containerId":"MJ7AIz7l0ae5bmNt","originalText":"MATRIZ DE RETENCIÓN Y SUPRESIÓN PERIÓDICA:\n\n• Cuentas y notas: Durante la relación contractual + 5 años.\n• Facturación y pagos: 10 años conforme a la obligación fiscal DIAN.\n• Grabaciones de clase: Plazo definido por ciclo académico (prohibido 'para siempre').\n• Consentimientos y logs: Conservación permanente como evidencia de cumplimiento.","lineHeight":1.25,"baseline":12,"autoResize":true},{"type":"rectangle","version":1,"versionNonce":1421849673,"isDeleted":false,"id":"GXaEKFznpsguS8Jc","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":1.0,"strokeStyle":"solid","roughness":0,"opacity":100,"angle":0.0,"x":915.0,"y":120.0,"strokeColor":"#FCA5A5","backgroundColor":"#FFFFFF","width":860.0,"height":760.0,"seed":531786506,"groupIds":[],"frameId":"ax63wCE39PGM3vqL","roundness":{"type":3},"boundElements":[],"updated":1,"link":null,"locked":false},{"type":"text","version":1,"versionNonce":417495936,"isDeleted":false,"id":"yCKGCXOXf2Oe4vKt","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":1.5,"strokeStyle":"solid","roughness":0,"opacity":100,"angle":0.0,"x":931.0,"y":132.0,"strokeColor":"#64748B","backgroundColor":"transparent","width":563.0,"height":25.0,"seed":882750389,"groupIds":[],"frameId":"ax63wCE39PGM3vqL","roundness":null,"boundElements":[],"updated":1,"link":null,"locked":false,"fontSize":11,"fontFamily":3,"text":"2. PROTOCOLO DE GESTIÓN DE INCIDENTES DE SEGURIDAD (8 FASES)","textAlign":"left","verticalAlign":"top","containerId":null,"originalText":"2. PROTOCOLO DE GESTIÓN DE INCIDENTES DE SEGURIDAD (8 FASES)","lineHeight":1.25,"baseline":11},{"type":"rectangle","version":1,"versionNonce":1460934798,"isDeleted":false,"id":"bNyHNxRUNGxxpDCU","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":1.5,"strokeStyle":"solid","roughness":0,"opacity":100,"angle":0.0,"x":940.0,"y":170.0,"strokeColor":"#0C0C0C","backgroundColor":"#FFFFFF","width":392.5,"height":135.0,"seed":492198379,"groupIds":[],"frameId":"ax63wCE39PGM3vqL","roundness